  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-control-19-betweenScale> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/parameterStep> "0.1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-control-19-betweenScale> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-control-19-view> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/ExperimentParameter> .
