  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-control-19-withinScale> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/parameterStep> "0.1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-control-19-withinScale> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/MathExpression> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Divide the between-group mean square by the within-group mean square. A positive within-group mean square is required for this finite ratio."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/formulaLabel> "Between-group variation relative to within-group variation"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-formula-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/latex> "F=\\frac{\\mathrm{MS}_{B}}{\\mathrm{MS}_{W}}" .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-07> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Group means and the grand mean"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-07> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-13> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-13> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What makes F large?"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-13> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-19> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-19> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Place F on the null distribution"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-heading-19> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/DefinitionListEntry> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Every symbol, unit and model condition"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> """- **F**: dimensionless omnibus test statistic.
- **$MS_B$**: group-size-weighted between-group sum of squares divided by (k−1), in percentage points squared.
- **$MS_W$**: residual within-group sum of squares divided by (N−k), in percentage points squared.
- **B/W**: subscripts meaning between groups/within groups.
- **k**: number of groups; k>1.
- **N**: total observations; N>k.
- **=**: equality.
- **fraction bar**: division of $MS_B$ by $MS_W$.

The fixed-effects model assumes independent Normal errors with a common positive variance. The omnibus test asks whether all population means are equal. $MS_W$ must be positive; F is undefined when this error mean square is zero."""@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/DefinitionList> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasDefinitionListEntry> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f-symbols> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-legend-f> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova-definition> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova-definition> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "A joint comparison of population group means using between-group and within-group mean squares under a fixed-effects independent Normal common-variance model."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova-definition> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova-definition> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l5-f-distribution> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l6-df> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Concept> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One-way analysis of variance"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasDefinition> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova-definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-one-way-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
}

