  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/supportsResource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-chart-07> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/supportsResource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-chart-13> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/supportsResource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-chart-19> .
